# covers: 14 Generic functions
# covers: 14 Nested generics
# covers: 2 Function types
# covers: 5 Higher-order functions
# covers: 14 Generic constraints
# kind: positive
# expect: run
# exit: 0
# stdout: 9
# stdout: 97

layeredGenerics is module
layeredGenerics purpose "A generic operation that calls another generic operation at its own type parameter and takes a generic operation type"
layeredGenerics path layeredGenerics
layeredGenerics imports standard.console
layeredGenerics imports standard.list
layeredGenerics imports standard.compare
layeredGenerics imports standard.convert
layeredGenerics exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParameter none
showInt input value Int64 copied
showInt output none
showInt outputOwnedBy none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memoryHeap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt let none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue argument value Int64 value copy
writeValue result none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError
writeValue suppresses console.WriteError.failed

Better is operationType
Better purpose "Whether the left value should be kept over the right one"
Better typeParameter T plain
Better input left T copied
Better input right T copied
Better output Bool
Better outputOwnedBy none
Better raises none
Better effect none
Better async false

pick is operation
pick purpose "Return the first value when the flag is true, else the second"
pick invariant none
pick typeParameter T plain
pick input flag Bool copied
pick input first T copied
pick input second T copied
pick output T
pick outputOwnedBy none
pick raises none
pick effect none
pick uses none
pick memoryHeap false
pick async false
pick maxRecursion none
pick label begin loopKind none
pick label begin within none
pick label takeFirst loopKind none
pick label takeFirst within none
pick label takeSecond loopKind none
pick label takeSecond within none
pick let none
pick at begin branch if flag goto takeFirst else goto takeSecond
pick at takeFirst return ok first
pick at takeSecond return ok second

bestOf is operation
bestOf purpose "The value every other value of the list loses to under `better`, the first among equals"
bestOf invariant none
bestOf typeParameter T plain
bestOf input items ItemsT borrowed
bestOf input better BetterT copied
bestOf output T
bestOf outputOwnedBy none
bestOf raises list.IndexOutOfRange
bestOf effect none
bestOf uses none
bestOf memoryHeap false
bestOf async false
bestOf maxRecursion none
bestOf label begin loopKind none
bestOf label begin within none
bestOf label start loopKind none
bestOf label start within none
bestOf label scan loopKind forEach
bestOf label scan within none
bestOf label scan maxIterations count
bestOf label scan over items
bestOf label compare loopKind none
bestOf label compare within scan
bestOf label done loopKind none
bestOf label done within none
bestOf label empty loopKind none
bestOf label empty within none
bestOf let best T unset mutable
bestOf let zero Int64 0 immutable
bestOf at begin do countItems
bestOf at begin do readFirst
bestOf at begin branch ifError readFirst goto empty else goto start
bestOf at start set best first
bestOf at start goto scan
bestOf at scan branch ifNext items bind item T goto compare else goto done
bestOf at compare do judge
bestOf at compare do choose
bestOf at compare set best chosen
bestOf at compare goto scan
bestOf at done return ok best
bestOf at empty return error emptyError

countItems is call
countItems in bestOf
countItems invokes ItemsT.length
countItems argument list ItemsT items lend
countItems result count Int64
countItems ownedBy none
countItems cleanedBy none
countItems borrows none
countItems catch none
countItems suppresses none

