ItemsT is typeInstance
ItemsT purpose "The list bestOf reads"
ItemsT in bestOf
ItemsT instantiates list.List T

BetterT is typeInstance
BetterT purpose "The comparison bestOf is given"
BetterT in bestOf
BetterT instantiates Better T

pickAt is operationInstance
pickAt purpose "pick at bestOf's own type"
pickAt in bestOf
pickAt instantiates pick T

Numbers is typeInstance
Numbers purpose "Whole numbers in a list"
Numbers in none
Numbers instantiates list.List Int64

BetterNumber is typeInstance
BetterNumber purpose "A comparison of whole numbers"
BetterNumber in none
BetterNumber instantiates Better Int64

bestNumber is operationInstance
bestNumber purpose "bestOf for whole numbers"
bestNumber in none
bestNumber instantiates bestOf Int64

